* Mn2+ nonbonded parameters — Li-Merz 12-6 CM set (TIP3P), JCTC 2013, 9, 2733.
* Rmin/2 = 1.407 Angstrom ; epsilon = 0.0168671 kcal/mol.
*

NONBONDED nbxmod 5 atom cdiel fshift vatom vdistance vfswitch -
cutnb 14.0 ctofnb 12.0 ctonnb 10.0 eps 1.0 e14fac 1.0 wmin 1.5
MN     0.0  -0.0168671   1.407

END
